    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Using 1 minute, you can transform yourself into a human. While human, you appear as you did before getting affected by the worgen curse. You always appear as the same human when you transform. You can transform back into a worgen as a free action on your turn, and you immediately revert to your worgen form if you make an attack or casts a spell that affect an enemy creature.</p>",
